-1dds9rz">Now let=E2=80=99s move on to computer vision tasks, which deal wi=
th understanding and interpreting visual information from images or videos.=
</p> <p data-svelte-h=3D"svelte-3s8uqe">There are two ways to approach comp=
uter vision tasks:</p> <ol data-svelte-h=3D"svelte-d0r2mi"><li>Split an ima=
ge into a sequence of patches and process them in parallel with a Transform=
er.</li> <li>Use a modern CNN, like <a href=3D"https://huggingface.co/docs/=
