s on convolutional layers but adopts modern network designs.</li></ol> <blo=
ckquote class=3D"tip"><p data-svelte-h=3D"svelte-11ca85k">A third approach =
mixes Transformers with convolutions (for example, <a href=3D"https://huggi=
ngface.co/docs/transformers/model_doc/cvt" rel=3D"nofollow">Convolutional V=
ision Transformer</a> or <a href=3D"https://huggingface.co/docs/transformer=
s/model_doc/levit" rel=3D"nofollow">LeViT</a>). We won=E2=80=99t discuss th=
ose because they just combine the two approaches we examine here.</p></bloc=
kquote> <p data-svelte-h=3D"svelte-61m0mo">ViT and ConvNeXT are commonly us=
