on, segmentation, and depth estimation, we=E2=80=99ll look at DETR, Mask2Fo=
rmer and GLPN, respectively; these models are better suited for those tasks=
.</p> <h3 class=3D"relative group"><a id=3D"image-classification" class=3D"=
